cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CrossArm in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CrossArm: ABB RAPID to FANUC TP converter"
abstract: >-
  CrossArm converts ABB industrial robot programs written in RAPID, from a RobotWare
  backup or loose modules, into FANUC TP programs (.LS): motions, positions, tool and
  user frames, arm configuration, I/O, registers and program logic, with a conversion
  report of everything left to review. The two robot makers' conventions for arm
  configuration and joint axes, their speeds, zones and paths were measured on both
  controllers, not assumed.
